'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an antisocial NPC and adventurer from Castle Village. He is a co-worker of [[Alesia]] who manages the [[Castle Village Outpost]] and visits the valley with her.

Compared to Alesia, Isaac possesses a frank and ill-tempered demeanour. He is prideful, though arrogantly so.

