==Quotes==
<!---Keep to a list of 5 quotes for general section and 2-3 for events--->
Here is a selection of {{PAGENAME}}'s dialogue lines.
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">* General <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Regular}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Mondays|quote= "If you see anything out of the ordinary, tell Alesia. She's tracking monsters' movements to report to the Guild."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Wednesdays|quote="*grumble* I can never get enough to drink on hot days like this. Feels like I'm drying up from the inside out."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Saturdays|quote= "Staying alert, [Player]? You never know when something could come creeping up on you around here. Luckily for me, I'm always two steps ahead. Just stay out of my way."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= 4th of season|quote= "Can't you see I'm trying to relax here? Leave me."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= 5th and 11th of season|quote= "I've cleared so many mine levels I lost count."}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">* Events <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Events}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Stardew Valley Fair|quote= "Hmph. These weapons aren't bad. Mmm? What do you want? (Isaac is now ignoring you.)"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Spirit's Eve|quote= "Defeating a shadow brute is child's play. The narrative changes when bringing one in alive... Make yourself useful and bring me that 'spiced pumpkin cider'."}}
